
@startuml
title PC Build Configuration - Edit Saved Build

autonumber

actor User

participant "SavedBuildsPanel\n(Swing UI)" as UI
participant "EditBuildDialog" as Dialog
participant "SetupFacade\n<<Facade>>" as Facade
participant "JsonBuildRepository" as Repo
participant "CompatibilityService" as Service
participant "BuildEventPublisher\n<<Subject>>" as Publisher
participant "SavedBuildsObserver\n<<Observer>>" as Observer

User -> UI: Click "Edit selected"
UI -> Dialog: Open edit dialog
activate Dialog

User -> Dialog: Select new component
User -> Dialog: Click "Save changes"

Dialog -> Facade: updateBuild(buildId, newComponent)
activate Facade

Facade -> Repo: findAll()
Repo --> Facade: List<PcBuild>

note right of Facade
Rebuild PC configuration
with the same build ID
and replace one component
end note

Facade -> Service: validate(updatedBuild)
Service --> Facade: Validation errors

alt Build is compatible

    Facade -> Repo: save(updatedBuild)
    Repo --> Facade: Saved successfully

    Facade -> Publisher: notifyObservers(UPDATED)
    activate Publisher

    Publisher -> Observer: onBuildChanged(event)
    activate Observer

    Observer -> Facade: getSavedBuilds()

    Facade -> Repo: findAll()
    Repo --> Facade: Updated builds
    Facade --> Observer: List<PcBuild>

    Observer -> UI: updateBuildList(builds)
    UI --> Observer: UI refreshed

    deactivate Observer
    deactivate Publisher

    Facade --> Dialog: Updated PcBuild

    Dialog --> User: Show success message

else Build is incompatible

    Facade --> Dialog: IllegalArgumentException

    Dialog --> User: Show validation error

end

deactivate Facade
deactivate Dialog

@enduml
